{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Watchword is a roguelike deck builder about playing words to beat increasingly difficult trials with rule-breaking synergies and combos.</strong>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>This is a demo for the full game where you play with a limited number of upgrades &amp; items available to you.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606170/extras/PiecesHighlight2.gif?t=1743685519\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A good vocabulary will certainly help, but it will mostly take careful planning and strategy to beat each trial. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invent crazy new words and use special symbols to play a board that scores massively! Fill your bag and customize your collection of pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606170/extras/BooksHighlight_no_matte.gif?t=1743685519\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Purchase books to ramp up your point scoring.\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each book has a unique power that can help (or potentially hinder) depending on what pieces you use. Some books completely change the rules of the game. Explore, and discover  clever combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606170/extras/UniqueRuns.gif?t=1743685519\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Runs are procedurally generated and unique every time. In your travels you will come across run-changing encounters that will help determine your fate. Will you pass the trials and join the Watchguards?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606170/extras/Watchguard.gif?t=1743685519\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo Includes:</strong>\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">25+ Unique book relics with unique powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hundreds of piece variations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full runs of the game (No limit!!)\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 Watchguards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15 run Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 Spells</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3606170?t=1743685519","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606170/4d3b81faa83ae8fb034e70e3db6cc0b0f6ae4e43/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743685519","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606170/6d2231da4a5518e48899a9915d24236ae6e173f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743685519","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606170/6d2231da4a5518e48899a9915d24236ae6e173f1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743685519","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Watchword is a roguelike deck builder about playing words to beat increasingly difficult trials with rule-breaking synergies and combos.</strong>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>This is a demo for the full game where you play with a limited number of upgrades &amp; items available to you.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606170/extras/PiecesHighlight2.gif?t=1743685519\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A good vocabulary will certainly help, but it will mostly take careful planning and strategy to beat each trial. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invent crazy new words and use special symbols to play a board that scores massively! Fill your bag and customize your collection of pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606170/extras/BooksHighlight_no_matte.gif?t=1743685519\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Purchase books to ramp up your point scoring.\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each book has a unique power that can help (or potentially hinder) depending on what pieces you use. Some books completely change the rules of the game. Explore, and discover  clever combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606170/extras/UniqueRuns.gif?t=1743685519\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Runs are procedurally generated and unique every time. In your travels you will come across run-changing encounters that will help determine your fate. Will you pass the trials and join the Watchguards?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606170/extras/Watchguard.gif?t=1743685519\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo Includes:</strong>\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">25+ Unique book relics with unique powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hundreds of piece variations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full runs of the game (No limit!!)\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 Watchguards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15 run Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 Spells</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Big Quail Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2906730","name":"Watchword"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets